{
    "title": "\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0627\u0642\u0631\u0629 - \u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u0630\u0643\u0627\u0621 \u0648 \u062a\u062d\u062f\u064a",
    "description": "Are you ready to challenge your mind? \u2728 Geniuses Game is the perfect game for all knowledge and entertainment lovers!\r\n\r\nEnjoy thousands of interesting and fun questions in various fields:\r\n\r\nGeneral Culture: Instill in yourself a passion for knowledge and discover new facts.\r\nScience: Explore the world of science and discover answers to your questions.\r\nMath: Sharpen your intelligence and solve math problems in a fun way.\r\nHistory: Review important historical events and their influential figures.\r\nAnd much more!\r\nWhy choose Geniuses Game?\r\n\r\nRich and renewed content: constantly new and exciting questions.\r\nSuitable for all ages: from children to adults, everyone will find fun.\r\nAttractive graphics and user-friendly design.\r\nOFFLINE PLAY: Enjoy the game anytime, anywhere.\r\nCompletely free: no need to pay any fees!\r\nNew challenges without the Internet\r\n\r\nAdditional features:\r\nFriends Challenge Mode: Compete with your friends and family and share the results.\r\nDetailed statistics: Track your progress and try to break your records.\r\nIntuitive user interface: easy to use even for beginners.\r\n\r\nDownload the Geniuses game now and start your journey in the world of knowledge!",
